Breaks: vdr-plugin-text2skin (<< 1.3.4+git20170702-4fnu0~)
Description: common files for the anthra skins of the VDR text2skin plugin
 The anthra skins are generated from XML parts according to a set of
 options. This package provides vdr-skin-anthra-update, which builds a
 skin from its sources in /usr/share/vdr-skin-anthra and its options in
 /etc/vdr/anthra into /var/lib/vdr/plugins/text2skin, so local options
 survive upgrades.
